###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - A pure evaluation of pretrained models: nothing to encode as MLIPRun, and the benchmark quantities (volume change on optimisation, MD stability, bulk-modulus and heat-capacity errors, interaction-energy MAE on GoldDAC) have no MetricProperty. With more metric properties (v0.2.0 proposal) the per-model tables could be linked to registry models; the releases of the roughly 20 models would have to be pinned from the paper's model table first.
# - The interaction-energy errors on the 312 GoldDAC structures are energy differences, not total-energy errors, and are given per model in figures; they were left out and not forced into EnergyProperty.
# - Structure sets: 4 prototypical MOFs, 96 main structures (MOFs, zeolites, COFs), 13 Cu MOFs, 231 heat-capacity structures, 312 GoldDAC structures. Code: https://github.com/AI4ChemS/mofsim-bench. Read from arXiv v1; arXiv id matched by title and author.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
